{"4125460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PuPu Blood", "steam_appid": 4125460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>💩IT’S A SH*@#T GAME, BUT NEVER A SH*@#TY GAME! 💩</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUPU BLOOD</strong> is a fast-paced, frantic, and brutal shooter with dark humor — all wrapped in a unique and original style never seen before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world made entirely of waste, what kind of existence awaits poor little <strong>PuPu Blood</strong>? A meaningless scrap, lost and hopeless. Searching for purpose in a bizarre place where chaos and the self-aware inanimate beings that dwell within defy all logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNCOVERING THE MYSTERIES OF THIS PLACE... IS THE ONLY THING LEFT TO DO.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125460/extras/6fcefaa45d4e38f8dad857252d6fdb38.poster.avif?t=1785347668\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125460/extras/6fcefaa45d4e38f8dad857252d6fdb38.webm?t=1785347668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125460/extras/6fcefaa45d4e38f8dad857252d6fdb38.mp4?t=1785347668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EPIC AND UNFORGETTABLE COMBAT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, slide, climb, and dash with pure frenzy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t let them dance — shoot and shred those damn turds, wipe out every single one of them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peculiar bosses, full of charisma and personality.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GETTING RID OF CRAP HAS NEVER BEEN THIS FUN!!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re tired of being all backed up... you need some fiber, some water… and a bit of stress relief. Smash them again and again — you’ll feel much better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125460/extras/bea789fd94b73f1dc7c787aef92a342a.poster.avif?t=1785347668\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125460/extras/bea789fd94b73f1dc7c787aef92a342a.webm?t=1785347668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125460/extras/bea789fd94b73f1dc7c787aef92a342a.mp4?t=1785347668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>HAVE YOU EVER WONDERED WHAT YOUR SH*@#T DOES AFTER YOU FLUSH?</strong></i><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start the journey and discover...<br><strong>THE ADVENTURES OF A LITTLE PIECE OF PUPU, LOST AND PURPOSELESS IN A WORLD OF WASTE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125460/extras/ae4f10c14225eadc5c6571fe4e853317.poster.avif?t=1785347668\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125460/extras/ae4f10c14225eadc5c6571fe4e853317.webm?t=1785347668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125460/extras/ae4f10c14225eadc5c6571fe4e853317.mp4?t=1785347668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>P.S.: Remember… Of all pleasures without sin, the sweetest one is TAKING A SH*@